er questões oriundas deste contrato.	[center]{{LOJA_CIDADE}}, {{DATA_CONTRATO}}[/center]\n\n\n[signatures]VENDEDORA|{{LOJA_RAZAO_SOCIAL}}||COMPRADOR(A)|{{CLIENTE_NOME}}[/signatures]	{}	\N	54db7881-ce90-42d4-baff-0e0ec2cb9eeb	54db7881-ce90-42d4-baff-0e0ec2cb9eeb	2026-07-17 17:48:05.346871+00	2026-10-02 13:38:39.034093+00	\N	https://xktihtajunjmzbltqmrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/contract-assets/watermark/1784311442227-4ujkf9t675s.png	\N	0.1	[]	{moto}	{Fiscal,Garantia,Financeiro,Documentação,Outros}
